348
00:21:36,740 --> 00:21:38,657
I don't remember telling you about it.

349
00:21:38,740 --> 00:21:39,570
Remember?

350
00:21:39,653 --> 00:21:41,087
You helped me in the saloon.

351
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:47,089
I can recognize the smell of
gunpowder and grease instantly.

352
00:21:47,640 --> 00:21:48,600
Well, now...

353
00:21:49,960 --> 00:21:51,360
You bastards! I'll...

354
